000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.           TMNTHWDN.
000400 AUTHOR.               KURT MOVSESIAN.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.         JUNE 9, 1989.
000600*INSTALLATION.         GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
000700
000800*REMARKS.  MONTHLY WRITEDOWN PROCEDURE.  ALL CODES MARKED
000900*          FOR WRITEDOWN WITH A VALUE OF 50 DOLLARS ARE MORE
001000*          ARE WRITTEN DOWN BY 1.25% MONTHLY (15% YEARLY).
001100*          THE WRITEDOWN DEPT. (DEFAULT DEPT) IS CHARGED FOR
001200*          THE AMOUNT OF THE WRITEDOWN.
      *C
      *C   14FEB1994    DAVE PLUM
      *C     ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER - MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C   SEPT 16, 1996   CA YODER
      *C     MODIFIED PROGRAM FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C   30JAN1997    DAVE PLUM
      *C     CORRECTED THE CENTURY LOGIC USED TO WRITE RECORDS TO
      *C     DTRANS.  ALL RECORDS WERE BEING WRITTEN WITH A CENTURY
      *C     VALUE OF "20".
      *C
      *C   12FEB1997    DAVE PLUM
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO TRY AND OBTAIN THE ACCOUNT VALUE TO BE
      *C     USED FOR WRITEDOWN TRANSACTIONS FROM THE MACCOUNT-INFO
      *C     DATASET INSTEAD OF RELYING ON THE HARDCODED VALUE OF
      *C     "000250".  THIS CHANGE WAS REQUESTED BY NAPANEE SINCE
      *C     "000250" IS NOT THE VALUE THAT THEY WISH TO USE.
      *C
DP9802*C  27FEB1998    DAVE PLUM
DP9802*C     REVISED TO NO LONGER WRITE RECORDS TO DTRANS WHICH HAVE
DP9802*C     A VALUE OF $0 (QTY=0, VAUE=0).  THESE RECORDS SERVE NO
DP9802*C     POSITIVE PURPOSE.  HOWEVER, THEY DO CAUSE WARNING MESSAGES
DP9802*C     TO BE PRINTED ON THE THE TDLTCHGS REPORT.
DP9802*C
